BT 1 0 0 1 0 297 Tm /F4+0 15 Tf 26 TL (Nobody walks into recovery proud. We get here beat \001 out) Tj T* (of tricks, out of excuses, out of people who still believe us.) Tj T* (And that's the good news. Admitting we're powerless over) Tj T* (our addiction isn't losing the fight. It's finally admitting the) Tj T* (fight was rigged. For years we kept swinging at something) Tj T* (that never got tired, never slept, never missed a chance.) Tj T* (Today we get to set the gloves down. We don't have to win.) Tj T* (We just have to quit lying about who's been winning. That) Tj T* (honesty feels like defeat at first. It isn't. It's the first solid) Tj T* (ground we've stood on in a long time. For today, we don't) Tj T* (have to beat it. We just have to tell the truth about it \001 and) Tj T* (stay clean while we do.) Tj T* ET
