BT 1 0 0 1 0 271 Tm /F4+0 15 Tf 26 TL (The disease loves big numbers. Never again. The rest of) Tj T* -0.196955 Tw (your life. Forever. It hands us forever like a weight we were) Tj T* 0 Tw (never built to lift, then laughs when we drop it. We don't) Tj T* (carry forever. We carry today. Today has edges. It has a) Tj T* (morning and a night and a pillow at the end. We can stay) Tj T* (clean from here to that pillow. Nobody in the rooms got) Tj T* (years by staring at years. They got them the same way) Tj T* (we're getting this one \001 one day stacked on another, most) Tj T* (of them ordinary, some of them ugly, every one of them) Tj T* (enough. So put forever down. It was never ours to hold.) Tj T* (Pick up today. It fits in your hands.) Tj T* ET
