BT 1 0 0 1 0 323 Tm /F4+0 15 Tf 26 TL (Nobody warned us about this part. We put the drugs down,) Tj T* (and the feelings showed up all at once, like they'd been) Tj T* (waiting in the parking lot for years. Anger with nowhere to) Tj T* (go. Grief we skipped. Joy so sharp it almost hurts. For a) Tj T* (long time we kept all of it at arm's length. Now there's no) Tj T* (arm. Here's what the people with time will tell us: feelings) Tj T* (aren't facts, and they aren't emergencies. They pass. Every) Tj T* (single one of them passes, if we don't use over it. But if a) Tj T* (feeling includes wanting to die or hurt yourself, that is an) Tj T* (emergency. Tell staff now, or call or text 988. This is what) Tj T* (being alive feels like \001 loud, messy, and ours. We're not) Tj T* (broken because it hurts. We're healing because we can) Tj T* (finally feel it.) Tj T* ET
