BT 1 0 0 1 0 271 Tm /F4+0 15 Tf 26 TL (Recovery doesn't usually look like a movie. No swelling) Tj T* (strings, no sunrise on a mountaintop. Mostly it looks like a) Tj T* (made bed. A paycheck that goes where it's supposed to. A) Tj T* (promise kept on a Tuesday when nobody's watching. We) Tj T* (used to chase big. Big highs, big plans, big comebacks we) Tj T* (never came back from. Now the miracle is small and quiet,) Tj T* (and it shows up every day. Showing up on time. Answering) Tj T* (the phone. Looking someone in the eye. Don't skip the) Tj T* -0.208171 Tw (small things. They're not the warm-up to recovery. They are) Tj T* 0 Tw (recovery. Stack enough of them together, and one day you) Tj T* (look up and realize you've built a life.) Tj T* ET
