BT 1 0 0 1 0 245 Tm /F4+0 15 Tf 26 TL (If you're reading this, you're still here. Don't rush past that.) Tj T* (Some of us didn't make it. We carry their names. And every) Tj T* (morning we wake up clean, we're doing something they) Tj T* -0.066504 Tw (didn't get the chance to do. That's not guilt. That's purpose.) Tj T* 0 Tw (And if yesterday went sideways \001 if you used, if you ran, if) Tj T* -0.049658 Tw (you're reading this from the bottom again \001 the door didn't) Tj T* 0 Tw (lock behind you. It never does. Nobody in the rooms is) Tj T* (keeping score. We're just glad you came back. Today is) Tj T* (new. It doesn't know what you did. It only knows you're) Tj T* (here. So let's start there. Together.) Tj T* ET
