BT 1 0 0 1 0 375 Tm /F4+0 15 Tf 26 TL (We came in knowing everything. We knew what would) Tj T* (work, what wouldn't, and why the people in here were) Tj T* (different from us. Then we looked around. People whose) Tj T* (whole job is helping us get well. People in the next bed) Tj T* (who've been exactly where we are. Plenty of people who) Tj T* (need this never get the chance. Maybe it's time to let) Tj T* (somebody else's experience in. An open mind doesn't mean) Tj T* (we believe everything. It means we stop arguing long) Tj T* (enough to listen. Some of us say clean. Some of us say) Tj T* (sober. It's the same road. And if you take medication for) Tj T* (addiction as prescribed, that's clean time too. We try the) Tj T* (suggestion before we decide it won't work. We let the) Tj T* (person who's been here longer finish the sentence. Some of) Tj T* (the best things in recovery came wrapped in advice we) Tj T* (almost ignored.) Tj T* ET
