BT 1 0 0 1 0 349 Tm -0.182972 Tw /F4+0 15 Tf 26 TL (We replay it. What they said, what they did, what we should) Tj T* 0 Tw (have said back. We've run the tape so many times we know) Tj T* (every word. Resentment feels like justice. It feels like) Tj T* (keeping score for the good guys. But the person we're) Tj T* (angry at usually isn't losing any sleep. We are. We're the) Tj T* (ones swallowing the poison and waiting for them to get) Tj T* (sick. So try something different. Play the tape forward.) Tj T* (Where does this one end if we keep running it? For a lot of) Tj T* (us, it ends with using. We don't have to pretend it didn't) Tj T* (happen. We just have to ask what our part was, and what) Tj T* (we're willing to set down. If someone abused you, you had) Tj T* (no part in that. Talk it through with a counselor or sponsor.) Tj T* (Write it out. Let it out of the dark. Freedom is worth more) Tj T* (than being right.) Tj T* ET
