BT 1 0 0 1 0 323 Tm /F4+0 15 Tf 26 TL (Somebody had to make the coffee. Somebody unlocked the) Tj T* (door, set out the chairs, and stayed late to stack them) Tj T* (again. For a long time, we never wondered who that) Tj T* (somebody was. Then one night, someone handed us the) Tj T* (keys. Service sounds like a big word, but it's mostly small) Tj T* (things. Greeting the newcomer. Washing the pot. Giving) Tj T* (someone a ride. And here's what nobody tells you: it's not) Tj T* (really for them. When we're busy being useful, there's less) Tj T* (room for the self-obsession that kept us sick. You don't) Tj T* (have to wait until you leave. Stack the chairs after group.) Tj T* (Wipe down the table. Say hi to the next person who walks) Tj T* (in scared. When you get out, find a home group and grab a) Tj T* (job. Any job. It's the easiest way to stay.) Tj T* ET
