BT 1 0 0 1 0 245 Tm /F4+0 15 Tf 26 TL (Guilt says, I did something bad. Shame says, I am) Tj T* (something bad. Shame is the one that kept us using. It told) Tj T* -0.061298 Tw (us we were too far gone, too damaged, too much to fix \001 so) Tj T* 0 Tw (why bother trying? And shame loves the dark. It grows in) Tj T* (secrets. It shrinks the moment we say it out loud to) Tj T* (someone who doesn't flinch. That's what group is for, and) Tj T* (the rooms after that. We tell the truth, and someone nods,) Tj T* (because they did it too. We are not the worst thing we ever) Tj T* (did. We're people with a disease, getting better. You can) Tj T* (put the shame down. It was never yours to carry.) Tj T* ET
