BT 1 0 0 1 0 271 Tm /F4+0 15 Tf 26 TL (We're good at taking other people's inventory. What they) Tj T* (did wrong. Why they're the problem. We could write books) Tj T* (about everybody else. Eventually, recovery hands us a) Tj T* (pencil and asks us to write about ourselves. That's) Tj T* (terrifying, because we know what's in there. Or we think) Tj T* (we do. Here's what most of us found: the list was shorter) Tj T* (than we feared, and full of the same things everyone else) Tj T* (had. Fear. Selfishness. Hurt. Not monsters. People. An) Tj T* (honest look in the mirror isn't punishment. It's finally) Tj T* (seeing clearly enough to change. Do it with a counselor or) Tj T* (sponsor. Not alone.) Tj T* ET
