BT 1 0 0 1 0 271 Tm /F4+0 15 Tf 26 TL (Some days are just hard. Detox drags. The food is bad.) Tj T* (Somebody we love won't call back. And on those days,) Tj T* (someone in group says they're grateful, and we want to tell) Tj T* (them exactly where they can shove their gratitude. But) Tj T* (gratitude isn't pretending the bad stuff isn't happening. It's) Tj T* (noticing what's still standing in the middle of it. A bed. A) Tj T* (counselor down the hall. A number you'll take with you. A) Tj T* (day where the worst thing that happened was bad, and we) Tj T* (didn't make it worse. Write three things down tonight.) Tj T* (Small ones count. Especially small ones. Gratitude on a bad) Tj T* (day is the strongest kind.) Tj T* ET
