BT 1 0 0 1 0 245 Tm /F4+0 15 Tf 26 TL (Somebody did this for us. Somebody told the truth in a) Tj T* (room we almost didn't walk into. For a while, we sat in the) Tj T* (back and said nothing. Listening felt like enough. It wasn't.) Tj T* (When we keep quiet, nobody knows what we're carrying,) Tj T* (and nobody can help us carry it. There's an old saying in) Tj T* (recovery: we can't keep what we have unless we give it) Tj T* (away. Here's what it means. Recovery we keep to ourselves) Tj T* (starts to fade. Recovery we say out loud stays real. So raise) Tj T* (your hand. Not a speech. Just a quick check-in: here's) Tj T* (where I'm at today. It isn't for them. It's for us.) Tj T* ET
